  "question": {
    "text": "Tangents are drawn to the hyperbola <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math> at the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>. If these tangents intersect at the point <math><mi>T</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> then the area (in sq. units) of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is:",
